A hand-written client reads the Messages API server-sent events:

```typescript
for await (const event of events) {   // parsed SSE payloads
  switch (event.type) {
    case "content_block_delta": onDelta(event); break;
    case "message_delta": onDone(event); break;
    default: throw new Error(`unexpected event: ${event.type}`);
  }
}
```

Long responses sometimes fail with `unexpected event: ping`. What is the right change?
